OpenProject is open-source project management: work packages, Gantt,
boards, wiki, and time tracking. This CloudBSD port builds official
OpenProject 17.7.2 from source (bundle + frontend assets) and runs
Puma on 127.0.0.1:3000 behind nginx.

Operator config is JSON under /usr/local/etc/cloudbsd/openproject.
openproject(8) translates that JSON into OpenProject environment
variables (DATABASE_URL, OPENPROJECT_HOST__NAME, memcached, HTTPS).

Default track.cloudbsd.org layout:

  Puma          127.0.0.1:3000
  PostgreSQL    16 or 17 (port option, default 17)
  memcached     127.0.0.1:11211
  nginx         TLS terminator, X-Forwarded-Proto https
  Host          track.cloudbsd.org, OPENPROJECT_HTTPS=true

WWW: https://www.openproject.org/
